<[MIKE] M.KELLY36> I think I read them on the Net this A.M.
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> Except referring to polyForth and ANS Forth.
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> Or she may mean public domain "Forth".
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> Anyway FIG does "Forth" not Forth.
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> I like Elizabeth.  She is so very sane.
<[MIKE] M.KELLY36> I hear MVP has been resurrected ... sort of.
<GARY-S> By Glen haydon - more than sort of
<GARY-S> Don't look for the return of big ads, but MVP is definitely in business
